//! The shared NB2 vectors (protocol/vectors/nb2, generated by bft-core nb2ref, NB2-03 #1099), replayed against the Rust
//! plug-in byte for byte, as the TypeScript plug-in replays them (`test/nb2/vectors.test.ts`): Γ, the verifier (positive and
//! negative), seal receipts, gap proofs, chain folds, segment logs, the vault model, the wallet refusals and the primitives,
//! plus the redeem-error classification of every recorded vault revert. The file is imported by its digest.
#![cfg(feature = "host")]

